<title>USA: D.R. Horton to acquire Torrey for $112 mln.</title>
<headline>D.R. Horton to acquire Torrey for $112 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.R. Horton Inc said on Wednesday it signed a definitive agreement to buy the Torrey Group of Companies for $28.5 million in cash, $9.5 million in newly issued shares and $74 million in assumed debt.</p>
<p>Horton, a builder of homes for the entry-level and move-up markets, said acquiring the Atlanta-based Torrey would complement its existing Southeast region operations.</p>
</text>
